ursor-vim","original_url":"https://zenn.dev/yukimemi/articles/2021-03-13-dps-autocursor-vim"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":3,"users":["UFP0GQZ4K","UAZ33BKV2","UEX9VPSET"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ih4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8055b84a-a811-48d4-95d0-57fce316876c","type":"message","user":"UEX9VPSET","text":"`quickfix` は vim もちゃんと表示されます。だけどその後の grep 結果が何も出てこず・・・ `let g:asyngrep_debug = v:true` して、 console.log で stdout を出してるんですが、そこでも表示されないので、 Deno.run した後、プロセスがなんかハングしてる？のかな・・・","ts":"1615957481.013300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UTE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a631008-3564-4b86-a58f-6e3e9b67aeb5","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"これが怪しいかなーと漠然と思ってます","ts":"1615955104.009400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2wh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32afd097-b40e-4f74-a9e6-028eba723e2c","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"```      await vim.execute(\"botright copen\");```","ts":"1615955093.009000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U85"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a632ead1-e38a-4ac1-b574-af25acd61a44","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"これバッファが表示されないだけなのか `quickfix` に結果が出てないのか、どっちでしょうね","ts":"1615955079.008600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mloT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5e92c16-ff82-49b7-ad3d-83b3f577ea96","type":"message","user":"UEX9VPSET","text":"これ入れると、 Agp コマンド登録されて、起動すると ripgrep で grep して結果が quickfix 出るんですが、 neovim だと出て、 vim だと出ない","ts":"1615954792.007500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nm=33"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90b09aa8-1bb5-4e18-b4f4-cc5f0194b80b","type":"message","user":"UEX9VPSET","text":"あ、あげてました！\n\u003chttps://github.com/yukimemi/dps-asyngrep|https://github.com/yukimemi/dps-asyngrep\u003e","ts":"1615954629.007300","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: yukimemi/dps-asyngrep","id":1,"title":"yukimemi/dps-asyngrep","title_link":"https://github.com/yukimemi/dps-asyngrep","text":"Contribute to yukimemi/dps-asyngrep development by creating an account on GitHub.","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6442108?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/yukimemi/dps-asyngrep","original_url":"https://github.com/yukimemi/dps-asyngrep"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LPB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b434cd28-a444-405b-a976-4e2789054d76","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"はい、ちなみに、精査できるのは土日になると思います〜","ts":"1615954612.007200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xs9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e63d7020-b2a9-475a-b90b-925b534e1fbf","type":"message","user":"UEX9VPSET","text":"はい、仕事中なので、また時間できた時に！","ts":"1615954423.006300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]},{"name":"bow","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XAxh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57ac645b-819e-4eea-bdba-e86b68a606f0","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"いや違うか...再現コードが欲しいです〜","ts":"1615954309.006200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7exza"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0c17d24-7083-4724-b310-214b8c5deceb","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"どうやって呼んでます？ `notify` と `request` の違いかと邪推しています","ts":"1615954232.006000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uU0I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd3b6b46-4217-4f86-9ced-db48f7e991da","type":"message","user":"UEX9VPSET","text":"Deno.run でプロセス起動した後に、 await status() すると、 neovim だとちゃんと終わるのですが、 vim だと戻ってこないす……また neovim と vim の差かなぁ","ts":"1615954114.005600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tuw45"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D5951B17-783E-491A-AF42-612900E0D7D5","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"もう少し具体的な問題に落とし込めるとアドバイスできるかもしれません","ts":"1615946596.005500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TCtQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24021992-9747-4433-9db6-dbbf88e8bda1","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"とりあえず夜まで体力残ってたら続きやりますかね","ts":"1615943176.004500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9aKv0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a5c452f-b2b1-46cf-88e8-0eeb28d3157b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"たぶんGhostText自体は単純なWebSocketだからいいんですけど、バッファとの紐付けをどう管理したものか悩んでます\nPython版の実装はだいたいどれもpynvimゴリゴリなので参考にしづらい……","ts":"1615943145.004200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y/at"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20866378-b943-4a65-9e2e-b6cba1b4ea88","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"お、それができたら移行しようかな（Python版のGhostTextは依存パッケージをいちいち入れるのが若干面倒なので）","ts":"1615943032.003000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dy3se"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01c60dcb-ee03-449f-aa29-00a2fe86c19d","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"昨日からdenopsでGhostTextやろうと思っていろいろやってたんですけど、バッファを双方向で変化させる実装がなかなかしんどい","ts":"1615942647.001200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodjob","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","UL6CFN8NR"]},{"name":"totemoturai","count":3,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U7JL1UKKL","U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"del